WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.734 --> 00:00:00.867 line:0%
A

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.936 line:0%
VIABLE GOAL.

00:00:02.602 --> 00:00:04.771 line:0%
ROSEMARY?

00:00:03.737 --> 00:00:06.006 line:0%
&gt;&gt; THANKS TO PHIL BLACK,

00:00:04.938 --> 00:00:06.873 line:0%
JOINING US LIVE, FROM GLASGOW,

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:09.843 line:0%
SCOTLAND.

00:00:07.741 --> 00:00:11.811 line:0%
NOW, WE WANT TO SHOW YOU SOME

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:13.046 line:0%
INCREDIBLE IMAGES OF TUVALU'S

00:00:11.978 --> 00:00:15.815 line:0%
FOREIGN MINISTER, DELIVERING A

00:00:13.213 --> 00:00:17.851 line:0%
SPEECH TO THE COP26 SUMMIT,

00:00:15.982 --> 00:00:19.986 line:0%
KNEE DEEP IN SEAWATER.

00:00:18.018 --> 00:00:22.055 line:0%
WEARING A SUIT AND TIE, HE MADE

00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:23.123 line:0%
IT CLEAR, JUST HOW VULNERABLE

00:00:22.222 --> 00:00:26.860 line:0%
HIS LOW LYING, PACIFIC ISLAND

00:00:23.289 --> 00:00:29.796 line:0%
IS, TO RISING SEA LEVELS.

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:31.031 line:0%
TUVALU IS SITUATED MIDWAY

00:00:29.963 --> 00:00:33.066 line:0%
BETWEEN HAWAII, AND AUSTRALIA.

00:00:31.965 --> 00:00:36.002 line:0%
AND HERE IS PART OF HIS

00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:39.806 line:0%
RECORDED MESSAGE.

00:00:36.836 --> 00:00:40.807 line:0%
&gt;&gt; AND TO VELOUR, WE LIVE THE

00:00:39.973 --> 00:00:41.408 line:0%
REALITIES OF CLIMATE, CHANGE

00:00:40.974 --> 00:00:42.809 line:0%
AND SEA LEVEL RISE.

00:00:41.574 --> 00:00:43.176 line:0%
IT'S WHAT YOU SEE HERE, AT

00:00:42.976 --> 00:00:45.078 line:0%
COP26.

00:00:43.743 --> 00:00:46.813 line:0%
WE CANNOT WAIT FOR SPEECHES

00:00:45.245 --> 00:00:47.347 line:0%
WHEN THE SEA IS RISING AROUND,

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:50.150 line:0%
US ALL THE TIME.

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:50.650 line:0%
CLIMATE MOBILITY MUST COME TO

00:00:50.316 --> 00:00:52.786 line:0%
THE FOREFRONT.

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:54.788 line:0%
WE MUST TAKE BOLD, ALTERNATIVE

00:00:52.952 --> 00:00:56.189 line:0%
ACTION, TODAY, TO SECURE

00:00:54.954 --> 00:01:02.929 line:0%
TOMORROW.

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:04.864 line:0%
&gt;&gt; JOINING ME NOW, TO THE LIU

00:01:03.096 --> 00:01:06.232 line:0%
FOREIGN MINISTER, SIMON

00:01:05.031 --> 00:01:09.669 line:0%
CO-FAITH, SO THANK YOU SO MUCH

00:01:06.633 --> 00:01:12.105 line:0%
FOR TALKING WITH US.

00:01:09.836 --> 00:01:14.107 line:0%
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU, IT'S A PLEASURE.

00:01:12.806 --> 00:01:17.811 line:0%
&gt;&gt; YOU FILMED YOUR PLEASURE --

00:01:14.674 --> 00:01:18.978 line:0%
YOUR SPEECH FOR COP26, FOR

00:01:17.977 --> 00:01:21.815 line:0%
STANDING ME DEEP IN THE OCEAN.

00:01:19.145 --> 00:01:22.182 line:0%
THAT IMAGE HAS, ALREADY, GONE

00:01:21.981 --> 00:01:25.819 line:0%
VIRAL.

00:01:22.849 --> 00:01:26.386 line:0%
HAMMERING HOME THE IMPACT OF

00:01:25.985 --> 00:01:29.022 line:0%
RISING SEA LEVELS.

00:01:27.754 --> 00:01:30.990 line:0%
IT ESPECIALLY ON YOUR NATION,

00:01:29.189 --> 00:01:31.391 line:0%
AS WELL AS OTHERS PACIFIC

00:01:31.157 --> 00:01:33.860 line:0%
ISLANDS.

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:37.163 line:0%
WHAT ARE YOU EXPECTING ABOUT

00:01:34.027 --> 00:01:41.901 line:0%
THIS, IN TERMS OF GLOBAL ACTION?

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:44.904 line:0%
&gt;&gt; WELL, THANK YOU.

00:01:42.569 --> 00:01:48.808 line:0%
OUR PRIME MINISTER DELIVERED A

00:01:45.071 --> 00:01:49.876 line:0%
MESSAGE, AND THEY ARE

00:01:48.975 --> 00:01:51.077 line:0%
HIGHLIGHTING THE IMPACT OF

00:01:50.043 --> 00:01:54.180 line:0%
CLIMATE CHANGE IN TUVALU.

00:01:51.544 --> 00:01:56.816 line:0%
THE FACT THAT WE ARE SINKING.

00:01:54.714 --> 00:01:58.051 line:0%
SO, WE THOUGHT WE COULD

00:01:56.983 --> 00:02:00.954 line:0%
DEMONSTRATE THAT IN A VIDEO.

00:01:58.785 --> 00:02:01.354 line:0%
SO THAT PEOPLE HAVE AN IMAGE TO

00:02:01.121 --> 00:02:06.059 line:0%
LOOK AT.

00:02:02.722 --> 00:02:08.094 line:0%
WE NEED A PIECE OF THE REACTION

00:02:06.226 --> 00:02:09.229 line:0%
OF THE PUBLIC, AND IT'S GONE

00:02:08.261 --> 00:02:10.130 line:0%
VIRAL, AND WE DIDN'T EXPECT IT

00:02:09.729 --> 00:02:11.865 line:0%
TO GO THAT FAR UP.

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:13.133 line:0%
BUT, IT HAS.

00:02:12.031 --> 00:02:14.134 line:0%
WE HAVE BEEN VERY PLEASED WITH

00:02:13.299 --> 00:02:19.806 line:0%
THE IMPACT THAT IT HAS.

00:02:16.736 --> 00:02:21.975 line:0%
WE DO HOPE THAT IT HELPS

00:02:19.973 --> 00:02:23.977 line:0%
TRANSLATE SOME OF THESE

00:02:22.142 --> 00:02:27.280 line:0%
COMMITMENTS, INTO ACTIONS, AND

00:02:24.144 --> 00:02:28.815 line:0%
THEN WE SEE THE LEADERS TAKE A

00:02:27.447 --> 00:02:29.215 line:0%
STRONG STANCE, ON CLIMATE

00:02:28.982 --> 00:02:32.819 line:0%
CHANGE.

00:02:29.782 --> 00:02:34.821 line:0%
&gt;&gt; ACCORDING TO THE WORLD BANK,

00:02:32.986 --> 00:02:37.023 line:0%
WESTERN PACIFIC OCEAN LEVELS

00:02:34.988 --> 00:02:40.026 line:0%
HAVE RISEN UP TO 3 TIMES FASTER,

00:02:37.757 --> 00:02:41.828 line:0%
IN THE GLOBAL AVERAGE, AND IS

00:02:40.193 --> 00:02:42.295 line:0%
THAT WHAT YOU ARE SEEING ON

00:02:41.995 --> 00:02:43.830 line:0%
YOUR ISLAND?

00:02:42.595 --> 00:02:46.199 line:0%
ASSESSING YOUR NATION'S

00:02:43.997 --> 00:02:48.935 line:0%
VULNERABILITY TO GLOBAL WARMING?

00:02:46.766 --> 00:02:52.005 line:0%
&gt;&gt; IN FACT, WHERE I WAS

00:02:49.102 --> 00:02:54.674 line:0%
STANDING, AND TAKING MY

00:02:52.172 --> 00:02:55.208 line:0%
STATEMENT, THAT USED TO BE LAND,

00:02:54.841 --> 00:02:58.912 line:0%
MANY YEARS AGO.

00:02:56.609 --> 00:03:01.014 line:0%
BEHIND ME, YOU CAN SEE A

00:02:59.078 --> 00:03:04.017 line:0%
CONCRETE SLAB, AND THAT IS

00:03:01.181 --> 00:03:06.819 line:0%
ACTUALLY THE FOUNDATION OF A

00:03:04.184 --> 00:03:09.122 line:0%
WORLD WAR II AREA, BUILT BY THE

00:03:06.986 --> 00:03:09.989 line:0%
U.S. MILITARY, IN 1942, I THINK

00:03:09.756 --> 00:03:11.991 line:0%
IT WAS.

00:03:10.156 --> 00:03:13.126 line:0%
THAT, WAS ACTUALLY, ON LAND.

00:03:12.158 --> 00:03:14.994 line:0%
IF YOU LOOK INTO THE VIDEO, IT

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:15.995 line:0%
IS 20, OR 30 METERS IN THE

00:03:15.161 --> 00:03:18.998 line:0%
OCEAN, IN THE CITY.

00:03:17.564 --> 00:03:21.634 line:0%
SO, THE IMPACTS OF CLIMATE

00:03:19.165 --> 00:03:22.435 line:0%
CHANGE, AND SEA LEVEL RISE, IS

00:03:21.801 --> 00:03:23.102 line:0%
SOMETHING THAT IS A REALITY FOR

00:03:22.602 --> 00:03:26.072 line:0%
US, INTO VALUE.

00:03:23.770 --> 00:03:26.973 line:0%
WE WANTED TO CONVEY THAT

00:03:26.239 --> 00:03:29.642 line:0%
MESSAGE, TO PEOPLE, AND

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:31.010 line:0%
ALTHOUGH WE ARE FACING THAT

00:03:29.809 --> 00:03:31.344 line:0%
CHALLENGE NOW, ONE DAY, IT WILL

00:03:31.177 --> 00:03:31.344 line:0%
BE OTHER PAR

